---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | CT Studio NZ"
  description="How CT Studio NZ collects, uses and protects the personal information you send through this website."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <main>
      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="legal-page">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p><em>Last updated: 27 October 2026</em></p>
            <p>
              This policy explains what personal information CT Studio NZ
              collects through this website, why, and what you can ask us to do
              with it. It follows New Zealand's Privacy Act 2020.
            </p>

            <h2>Who we are</h2>
            <p>
              CT Studio NZ is a photography and videography studio in Rolleston,
              with photoshoots across Christchurch and Canterbury. You can reach
              us at <a href="mailto:ctstudionz89@gmail.com">ctstudionz89@gmail.com</a>
              or on <a href="tel:+64224663080">022 466 3080</a>.
            </p>

            <h2>What we collect</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, phone
                number (optional), the service you're interested in and your
                message.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>WhatsApp bookings:</strong> the details you choose to
                send us, such as your name, preferred date and time.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              We don't use tracking or advertising cookies on this website. Like
              most websites, the services that host and deliver it (Netlify,
              Cloudinary and Google Fonts) may record technical information such
              as your IP address.
            </p>

            <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
            <p>
              Only to reply to your enquiry, and to arrange and deliver your
              photo or video session.
            </p>

            <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
            <p>
              Contact form messages are delivered to us by Formspree, and
              WhatsApp messages by WhatsApp. We never sell your information or
              share it for marketing.
            </p>

            <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
            <p>
              Only as long as we need it for the purposes above, or as required
              by law.
            </p>

            <h2>Your rights</h2>
            <p>
              You can ask to see the personal information we hold about you, and
              ask us to correct or delete it. Just email or call us using the
              details above. If you're not happy with how we've handled your
              information, you can contact the
              <a href="https://www.privacy.org.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Office of the Privacy Commissioner</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</Base>
